    "description": "The Pet Foster Listing API allows users to retrieve a curated list of pets available for foster care within the pet adoption platform. This resource is essential for potential fosters looking to provide temporary homes for pets in need. The API supports various querying options to filter pets by breed, size, and other characteristics, enhancing the search experience. Typical consumers include animal rescue organizations and individuals interested in fostering pets, aiming to promote animal welfare and increase adoption rates.",
